      "updated": 1786440000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RECOMMENDED ROUTER  \u2022  Keep ToG as the default. Use M-ToG only where there are 2\u20134 distinct, useful evidence tracks.",
      "originalText": "RECOMMENDED ROUTER  \u2022  Keep ToG as the default. Use M-ToG only where there are 2\u20134 distinct, useful evidence tracks.",
