    {
      "id": "temu4vkixq5q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 935,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 1969849138,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1096626690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786440000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Keep GraphReason.run and Beam primitives as the only traversal engine.\n2. Add graph_reason_modular beside graph_reason; do not replace it.\n3. Validate a typed plan: 2\u20134 modules, unique IDs, DAG dependencies, bounded terms/relations.\n4. Give every module its own goal, seeds, trust policy, depth \u2264 3 and width \u2264 8.\n5. Intersect requested relations with actually offered relations.\n6. Run dependency levels concurrently with a global request budget and semaphore.\n7. Join by canonical node IDs/accessions; preserve origin, review state, confidence.\n8. Auto-writing kb_assert is forbidden \u2014 synthesis is not a verified fact.",
      "originalText": "1. Keep GraphReason.run and Beam primitives as the only traversal engine.\n2. Add graph_reason_modular beside graph_reason; do not replace it.\n3. Validate a typed plan: 2\u20134 modules, unique IDs, DAG dependencies, bounded terms/relations.\n4. Give every module its own goal, seeds, trust policy, depth \u2264 3 and width \u2264 8.\n5. Intersect requested relations with actually offered relations.\n6. Run dependency levels concurrently with a global request budget and semaphore.\n7. Join by canonical node IDs/accessions; preserve origin, review state, confidence.\n8. Auto-writing kb_assert is forbidden \u2014 synthesis is not a verified fact.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
