      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ToG advantages\n\u2022 Lowest latency/cost; discoveries steer the next hop immediately.\n\u2022 Best for one connected neighborhood and sparse KBs.\n\nM-ToG advantages\n\u2022 Higher coverage across evidence types; isolated retry and independent budgets.\n\u2022 More auditable: module traces, joins, gaps, and conflicts.\n\nGuardrails\n\u2022 Graph is still the only source of evidence. No second store or unbounded fan-out.\n\u2022 Rejected nodes never appear; unreviewed content stays labeled.\n\u2022 Missing module evidence means \u201cunknown,\u201d never \u201cfalse.\u201d",
      "originalText": "ToG advantages\n\u2022 Lowest latency/cost; discoveries steer the next hop immediately.\n\u2022 Best for one connected neighborhood and sparse KBs.\n\nM-ToG advantages\n\u2022 Higher coverage across evidence types; isolated retry and independent budgets.\n\u2022 More auditable: module traces, joins, gaps, and conflicts.\n\nGuardrails\n\u2022 Graph is still the only source of evidence. No second store or unbounded fan-out.\n\u2022 Rejected nodes never appear; unreviewed content stays labeled.\n\u2022 Missing module evidence means \u201cunknown,\u201d never \u201cfalse.\u201d",
